  "content": "<h2>关于</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/beautify-refabricated?color=00AF5C&amp;label=下载量&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_809311_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/809311.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本\"></a></p><h6>这是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-decorate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beautify</a> 的<strong>非官方 Fabric 版本</strong>，基于 <a href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 协议</a>授权，请支持原作！</h6><h2>模组内容</h2><p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/82240d271f55e1b30163f5c889c8d4f95414748cf105a2fc59511d868f8dca48/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f744453426968552e6a70672e706e67\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cfe784fb6b44808f1e82645adcb35ff730f3565c4a536ff65520b869e15ac803/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f61566e3442366d2e676966\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>什么是 Beautify？</strong></span></p><p>Beautify 是一款客户端与服务器通用的<strong>装饰模组</strong>，通过自定义模型添加了大量<strong>原版风格</strong>的建造装饰方案。</p><p>本模组的目标是在不扼杀想象力与创造力的前提下，提升建筑细节表现力。<br>\n此外，大多数方块都包含新功能。例如，盆栽植物（如单格高花卉）可通过骨粉进行繁殖。</p><p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>支持版本 [Fabric]：</strong> </span> 1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.x</p><p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>更多图片：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7wHu3qe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LGUotre.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M7AfS0o.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"446\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/63BR9j4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\">查看更多示例图片</span></a></p></div><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#9cf\">&nbsp;<strong>Jeikir 的展示视频：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5uXGHUit038?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p></div><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>功能概览：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">悬挂花盆</span>：含自定义花卉模型，支持多种植物</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">书堆</span>：提供不同模型，可为附魔台充能</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">百叶窗</span>：为窗户增添细节或创建新型入口</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">画框</span>：包含所有16x16原版画作主题及更多内容</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">绳索</span>：可悬挂花盆等方块，玩家可攀爬</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新型光源</span>：竹灯笼、烛台/枝形吊灯、荧光瓶、灯泡</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">格架</span>：用于在墙壁和天花板上放置植物</li>\n<li><em>持续更新中</em></li>\n</ul><p><em>关于方块及其用途的更多信息，请<strong><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><a style=\"color:#9cf\" href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">查阅维基百科！</a></span></strong></em></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">致谢：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/CapoFantasma97\" rel=\"nofollow\">CapoFantasma97</a></strong>（意大利语翻译）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ocarinayoy\" rel=\"nofollow\">ocarinayoy</a>&nbsp;</strong>（西班牙语翻译）</span></p>",
